{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_10018_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:549761e1162bb51a83002b48d5f36dd131df806ec9cd64fa51a0ca0fbaf72fc2",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bd1022a136521e41f8b7d94faaea776bfb1f37decf1190ca85a435032aded450",
      "text": "结交朋友大作战☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5262cb28f6d383b78cf5cfa7b96fcf43401693bdc6d42cec4723580d5adda2f3",
      "text": "四季、直央、涟、克里斯将组成\n白色情人节歌曲限定组合。\n收到了来自预定出演的音乐节目的问卷，\n大家想要好好了解彼此。然而，\n他们却很难找到机会和涟好好聊聊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_a:cmd-000012:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6bd711a0c587f0c078d13f61396e0634340adf4afbcabad0ac20aea8f2b2a191",
      "text": "序幕",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_a:cmd-000012:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bd1022a136521e41f8b7d94faaea776bfb1f37decf1190ca85a435032aded450",
      "text": "结交朋友大作战☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_a:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cc6d89f8517438412ddc6f12c9ef17086693f265041b9c8eed72ef0b2c626e81",
      "text": "啊。店里的橱窗布置变了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_a:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a6aab63078eae202983aebfbb850b0d902097760a30ea0774ef5c1ebb6de75e7",
      "text": "哇，摆满了面向白色情人节的点心呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_a:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a26f97909b496142b8445ec328ebce57727c1a424de1a2af9d31cfe8d7e51e63",
      "text": "不久之前，还摆满了\n各式各样的巧克力呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_a:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ab2ed7ad342a3422e61b6bb671928523718cd7566bf7e8f6b47fd3dc9d85d663",
      "text": "（下个月的这个时候，我和四季君、涟君，\n还有克里斯先生一起唱的新歌就要发售了）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_a:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2aa21a55cdae067bd98771fe5c3a93b6f2b180cc45a3892f7026e82a13d8852f",
      "text": "（决定和大家组成组合之后，\n明明都已经过去好一阵子了）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_a:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f44d8f8787d828f33b0c1d057845d6a872afc9b732961d23c5fd6fdec3b44654",
      "text": "（但里面还有几乎没怎么说过话的人……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_a:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3fb3e3dfd68825d5f946e5fbaba5a6c10754b72166702afb43330e1e97cf39fa",
      "text": "（要怎么做，才能更好地\n和大家聊上天呢？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_a:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8d8171c83b30df2ac7774b170590ab35eb02cd2adc87fce8d111c1b30bd04449",
      "text": "（我可是作为もふもふえん的代表\n来参加的）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_a:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4fd12408193aeb086d465c7d47c2c8ad169fd78e6ca38ef67783596d68fe5253",
      "text": "（可不能打退堂鼓）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_a:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d97f30e1a874b1de279640dc788f3a13b3932f6ad419a21d904476b943d77e96",
      "text": "（今天是要和大家一起进行第一次舞蹈练习，\n必须加油才行！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_b:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cfe6902e2010c901578ee99e4afc8054dc5106cb74c3f0086c4c628524b88589",
      "text": "大家辛苦了！下次预定出演的\n音乐节目给各位送来了问卷。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_b:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:69856d3961f2a19074e477699bd2586e45c88ac7f121327f15b8cde9c96eb506",
      "text": "提交截止是在出演的前一天。\n请在那之前填好哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_b:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:516d4a6afb26c141dfc209b0a1397e45414254d0e3feba5a87ce671dd60c2ca3",
      "text": "收到，●●●●プロデューサー酱！\n我看看……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_b:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a61f452a9ddbfe7e54be3b9675dd5b16ae78f53b2ac7b237113c778543bceff0",
      "text": "“组成了白色情人节限定组合后，\n有什么发生了改变吗？”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_b:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eca9d7b5e88f568bec425e6a38dc1b7148d32ea6493dd22ca559e345fd852081",
      "text": "“在这个组合成立之前和成立之后，\n对成员的印象有了怎样的改变？”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_b:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a7554b373d26519d7e916cec5df6d7ac3b589e6e27d7c79b34841df59c3aed5e",
      "text": "唔……关于组合的问题很多呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_b:cmd-000104:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1956eacc790d088e4437da9331ebbecdffe3c782204111def4208a179c411695",
      "text": "是的呢。这边的资料上，\n也有针对组合的提问……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_b:cmd-000110:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8ab9e2387eed54f55d596e3eb5abb9dc5a697a0e269afa08e931348eabf336d4",
      "text": "呼啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_b:cmd-000115:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:84d44c41a94cccafd6a58a5600dbe9fbafe95dd810acd2ecc181a61eea5f56ed",
      "text": "那个……涟君要不要也一起确认一下内容？\n离前往练习室还有一点时间……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_b:cmd-000123:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eb9bb6203e7c8c560611749ca5f28ca8d0e5d80e5b9fbe856a074384b8b34a7f",
      "text": "啊啊？麻烦死了。\n我哪有闲心一点点答这种玩意。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_b:cmd-000129:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e10bbee0b6364b1af497cbd46d88681d988f9ce269672b0dc4b20b605dfd11d5",
      "text": "你们自己弄去。我先过去了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_b:cmd-000134:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c19352422b1908ac0c84a982ae2320cf6c456386e8795acc77955707d3920ab8",
      "text": "啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_b:cmd-000147:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:68bd198b6631ec1eb7f93300e440b27e09d3b628476b07ba268d0eda65157b87",
      "text": "涟先生，等时间到了，\n我们就会移步练习室的哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_c:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:992010eea5dc2908a88ea33a89ef7536a45b3bb7fcc14a605b9d290d14c7fa78",
      "text": "走掉了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_c:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9e8a5d79dd8c76e2ab65b7bfadf957accef9b11dd48268257ee02fdd1ab4e834",
      "text": "呜～难得有个了解涟亲的\n好机会的说～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_c:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:93f5a7d20f23436c9bcb184e30c85b333e39e51286aea1b9096d815606217042",
      "text": "从听说要和这批成员一起出歌那天起，\n关于涟亲的情报就完全没增加过……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_c:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dd8cb1b82bab176a2a4d5c10b4b58a746bf14d40643ad3685f5321e93e98f8dd",
      "text": "因为MV大多是分开拍摄的，之后\n大家凑齐的工作也很少嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_c:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a0bc6d340b7ae4bf2b0fdb668228f600aad744369dcead68a2e224bdbcc55798",
      "text": "之前好不容易4个人凑齐一起练习，\n他也马上就回去了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_c:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:916ef0299763ae04cc4de3980e040eff00be411179d3251732cff04aaaa0c27f",
      "text": "哈啊，哈啊……\n已、已经精疲力竭了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_c:cmd-000106:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7df3bfeaf958508fc5de9e5a55571139dd1f5867f57554cfb14c02abb8cc866d",
      "text": "喂，你。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_c:cmd-000110:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:10a27587f457f79077678accf844c918d6409d012e48b258a45ae07bbea49292",
      "text": "是、是的……！有什么事吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_c:cmd-000118:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eafff0126300af17a72e23a8b96e92e66f403835e51d3f05c1b88eb387a6a8be",
      "text": "杂鱼就给我滚到后边去跳。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_c:cmd-000143:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e7771a83541ad1b6f01523eb68983fa23fb5bad792dfe5b4aceed5e4dd9afff5",
      "text": "……差不多就这样吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_c:cmd-000149:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:15b659c52915a25cd169d38aa0a830e2c4faa5eaeb56464f5d00fc2acae88cf6",
      "text": "哎呀，牙崎先生这就要回去了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_c:cmd-000152:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c1c468b47af57056f01a59866bffae2256cd4bcf542496b8cec8f24032f560b8",
      "text": "反正已经没什么可记的了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_d:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1f2323f70b61dbc51029f27677d19e8459e0819401953892895a8e21d0f594d2",
      "text": "能在那短短的时间里把舞步全部记住的\n涟君，真的好厉害啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_d:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6a57ba0047d31691f7356abdb06a80220092a2fd31e30326a87bd872719cc2c4",
      "text": "“已经没什么可记的了”……Mega帅呆了！\n我也好想试着这么说一次啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_d:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ed20d9abdc762012b68a3fd25fcdb89e66074795ea5ccb1d79cd507596c8e0c2",
      "text": "刚才这件事，或许可以写在问卷里\n关于“觉得成员厉害的地方”那一项呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_d:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2957b2dd3e11779e722da4dcd9392725db60b708b2f6a2a4247c457c7b74d18e",
      "text": "真的耶！\n这里就来写涟君的事吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_d:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:16a7fe411695d7407e09713c01734cf4412e3417d85ffa6c7b647997c293080c",
      "text": "那就由我来写！\n涟亲的舞蹈。记动作超快，搞定。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_d:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:54234b76b13511dbdf0d2bdac6d8c79c2b8ffa55a593169f975740681e54d834",
      "text": "照这个节奏，虽然想一口气填完，\n但果然还是想大家一起回答啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_d:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f0e54856cfd0c67542f12755fb31fa60bf2084bf55b801269b2bff4895a567ac",
      "text": "是啊。针对这次组合的问题很多，\n大家全员一起做确实比较好呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_d:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2a7af608bb3390e5bc875c31832d0c88446a20e2fa8dee3ef854c571afc563a9",
      "text": "那么，为了方便大家聚齐，\n我会把日程安排好的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_d:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cea2d92284137792b5e10b185b2961c1c78cbe81a2cc7bb71ce0fb8a67de90a5",
      "text": "那个，谢谢您，制作人。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_d:cmd-000109:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:75e79550537023d414d51e86c46a44f1aedb83cdbee9d9aa9ac188803e378f28",
      "text": "我也会为了能和涟君\n多说上话而努力的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_d:cmd-000119:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5dcea3a643e0c465294ccf88056bbf5c4ac8d63d07df68ac22d95f63f0aa496d",
      "text": "（要是能顺便教我跳舞就太开心了，\n不过这未免也太得寸进尺了吧）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_d:cmd-000132:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:86f02d3c6156b4c6cf561141c015cf1edc4644a46eeecd5336a6fa606abc5deb",
      "text": "互相交流语言、加深对彼此的了解，\n这种想法真是太棒了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_d:cmd-000138:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cd8e538e2d149eb16dd6100130cadff4e04f079249566b16d30e4ab58c4ce393",
      "text": "虽说是限定期间，但我们是乘在同一艘船上的\n水手同伴。目标的方向是一致的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_d:cmd-000145:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1583b71ec97f95a03cc3dff50fdc773aff05b789c7f4d39653451b92a7c471e0",
      "text": "那么，在待会儿的练习中，\n就来寻找和涟亲说话的机会吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_d:cmd-000175:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:88ef7ab03b99bce1b938f25b27814994ed4d15d16a9373763cf8dc1c69d5e4de",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，晚上好。\n可以占用您一点时间吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_d:cmd-000177:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9c3e0eab7135bbf0124c363d162784a0708abfe045d94917138ffb36a58b21a3",
      "text": "当然可以！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_d:cmd-000180:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1749b2e403ed486913e24bcd3490de927c37efc3a5846c0788bb31b203465499",
      "text": "非常感谢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_d:cmd-000182:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:78068f9752448bd36ec0689d69ff6249247fff7794308b26de0bf0536fbe9971",
      "text": "其实在今天的练习中，观察牙崎先生的一举一动时，\n我注意到了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_d:cmd-000184:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:070ce440e72010963934a78f93ccf7a87508528f697f31271d7747fbbb34aa9e",
      "text": "牙崎先生吃了好多\n●●●●プロデューサー送来的鲷鱼烧呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_d:cmd-000186:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:afadcbcbeeb31108b9f0aba0f463f9ea9b92ca4f7dc3d3f66590ae969f92874c",
      "text": "和我之前在视频里看到的一模一样。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_d:cmd-000188:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ddec8ea5be7f2797a6da327c217094dec7be15af14da90b01a90a22b1da1b2e3",
      "text": "我想着或许能以此作为话题的契机，\n便和他聊起了关于鲷鱼烧的事。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_d:cmd-000190:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:38877a6291b08eda56b30c17472cc7e720e87f26af1753770c93ffa103468234",
      "text": "当我和他聊起鲷鱼烧的天然物与养殖物的差别时，\n他表现出了浓厚的兴趣。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_d:cmd-000192:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bfcc26fec34e83d00069e7c029bfa1e8de31afe1018b72f50d0dd73a3ffdc21d",
      "text": "下次练习的时候，我会把两种都买来，\n大家一起品尝对比一番吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_d:cmd-000194:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:105a8c00debb8a678bd2bf022228c2d604da47b4a72c91034d47c6a2ed8db603",
      "text": "那么，因为我还要做明天的准备，\n就先失陪了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_d:cmd-000196:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:022ec0d0ccb1006887009e471fe1f4e10cc860f661451b4f6fc9784d63448687",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー也\n请好好休息。晚安。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_e:cmd-000010:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a2a40248a047b34eca4002dcdf855823097e67ae97e2d83de4a83373b48f972a",
      "text": "数周后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_e:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:13be93f10e1d64bf53bb54ea4e171a1eb6145f79605a4c6751df145df6c95a3d",
      "text": "（从那以后虽然在工作和练习中跟涟亲\n碰到了好几次，但完全没能说上话啊）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_e:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a03a403fd5a16c184c85eb7e69e172b681d18cb36fd618a533ed9ce0f7329bf2",
      "text": "（但是，我可不是会在这里轻易放弃的人。\n既然这样，在休息日去找他聊不就OK了吗！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_e:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:be06e4266db9f5b4a438a527a696a751227eea63dc5523ff6acb37c188f14868",
      "text": "既然决定了，那就突击男道拉面☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_e:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c46da151bd4b095604cbf1e1a283de8f93b41b47cae374ef7d4378458608804a",
      "text": "听说涟亲经常在那里嘛！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_e:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d026feb6cfef9061c3c880e5a5e032c22df1db96c1488a84de8dd07f61d2eff0",
      "text": "哎，等等？关门了？\n我看看……“临时休息”？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_e:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:11fd88fb2cd64b8767c4307ea1beaa483c1f9363ec0fb79ec77a7ddb0cabc705",
      "text": "怎、怎么会这样！难得以为能和\n涟亲说上话的说……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_e:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e65f9873948ae85c965e6f94799eaa6ee45a3714583fec73e0d193ef9244a05b",
      "text": "（不过，店休的话也没办法啦。\n明天再来吧！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_e:cmd-000098:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fc3a8ec19b6a1f5ddf39aa4eba2b59be346b45b0de5844d954f115fd2a720651",
      "text": "（既然空出时间了，去唱卡拉OK吧～）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_e:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c49d65cbbb6ecb1ad27e90f321ea48332ea44534e2f38113207022a7f433fe39",
      "text": "喵～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_e:cmd-000113:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fce0a3433a5adc913b54b2933324f78d042d0a193ea15484fcd9d785d856090c",
      "text": "啊——！是猫亲！\n喂——……等等，跑得好快！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_e:cmd-000121:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1d6e5b4e6d17bbf0ed0d6e7bc68a59de6c5c8f44818a51f7ba308d356224b5f2",
      "text": "这附近是它的地盘吗？\n反正以后还会来这儿，得好好打个招呼才行！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_f:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8802c90a61f90502d09c02e94b4e0ae1d62cb9caed62fc05321660ff74f5fbaa",
      "text": "喂——猫亲～！……不在啊。我还以为它\n跑到这边来了呢，是躲起来了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_f:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5df4a313233a7d7f9213ea69ef4e52c5fb77c113e5453f41f98663b57ec2fde9",
      "text": "喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_f:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:24e184ac06bdcab3363aae8d4fba8d92e71331a096a1827d638bfd38f26fa566",
      "text": "啊！在那儿！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_f:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1e7dec714a4dc3409bf231fffc79ee733c104e2809a2ca02499b61ac6f025f77",
      "text": "找到了！……咦，等等？\n和猫亲在一起的是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_f:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a6670c298ff70803c29bd57df2c007f59df901608982c592656f6454065c5964",
      "text": "拿去，霸王。开饭了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_f:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:360ba9083c5956cea80a92783b8bc7c49b4b06080d9ee4b822bed4c2b6131917",
      "text": "喵～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_f:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4076dfbc339b405d5188b9b7f3245c98e214ae49de1728ef2ca49e26e99f6baf",
      "text": "（发现涟亲啦！\n这可是搭话的大好机会啊！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_f:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d5cfe47e64d51a8b8b6d73026f4472368e9e88ba8f692e2e56c83b203ea13d87",
      "text": "喂——涟亲～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_f:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c49d65cbbb6ecb1ad27e90f321ea48332ea44534e2f38113207022a7f433fe39",
      "text": "喵～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_f:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:395e1e0587dd4b9f9651c99d8688715f896c700b3636d0c7194d15a0e800904d",
      "text": "…………",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_f:cmd-000110:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7db6b1be626eef9d7fa4485028819e12e18870dc14eefa87f2a473beb5e9dc9c",
      "text": "能在这种地方碰见真巧啊！\n这只猫亲是涟亲的熟人吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_f:cmd-000116:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:21808512f2cd5d0b0b400d3bfa71c4cfb87efe9b20ce77329bba3384094ce85d",
      "text": "我啊，超级Respect猫亲的哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_f:cmd-000121:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e56271f0fb69aca34c2a6a226c2fd1862e60a33580d9a1f62829ceade9503a64",
      "text": "仅凭自己一己之力在这个世界上生存下去，\n简直太Mega帅气了吧！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_g:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dc1f2936d60b050fa5c5aa78cd6e39013b200c1fb343cec2c256c49cd43898b1",
      "text": "哈！难道说涟亲也\n很Respect猫亲吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_g:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:36cfc74b8d0ccfdce7e45fcc433267af278c3ee8b1ba8eceacd0ce442c2be774",
      "text": "从刚才开始就叽叽喳喳吵个没完。\n啊啊？是想被我把眼镜打碎吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_g:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9ed7669937189f9ac37b9d575d130899dc846aceae8245113a716ef38e99c830",
      "text": "（和涟亲聊上的话不是比平时还要多吗？\n要是平时，早就走没影了呢）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_g:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8027fee5a342a1c03428a3145705b7f1a2ff72eeb620867a4773930db3480d18",
      "text": "（这全多亏了猫亲啊！既然如此！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_g:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:420edc00840685adf15aa427769016b3b0fc16c698ef0a7907dea479a7db16e7",
      "text": "那个……对了。\n你喜欢猫亲吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_g:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:20c1527d9cd4854c22b9007602d5bfb03ac95d853280c31364fbe98e341a0a84",
      "text": "烦死人了……\n话说，别用那种奇怪的称呼叫它。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_g:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:93be54f4f83e108d3f3b27b080bbacfa2b1c202dbf6788e740831f8dfcb2001d",
      "text": "诶诶诶！？一点都不奇怪啦！你试着叫我一声\n四季亲就能懂了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_g:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0854ad8ab0ddea2ab9a0b09235280d7ecd748573f60e2ba6fcf2899b12514078",
      "text": "谁要叫你啊，大～笨蛋。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_g:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7448100e95d1387467a428199228cd4b058b2773cceff6fe7c4633014aefad3a",
      "text": "明白啦。\n等我们感情变得更好了你再叫我吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_g:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6f0f299d0926879c2c9b3fe0402f2e450f58ee2cc6a2910a6a058af5b099bbaa",
      "text": "喵～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_g:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2a4cd4a1bdaec0031f0f811486eb5450ccdebcddc2d6954222ded1b334d25c90",
      "text": "这只猫亲，超级黏涟亲呢。\n好可爱～♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_g:cmd-000117:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2051b87e3b3c9acc3c41ecc7dd4997d5216169939c8f7b86bfdd49868361d7a3",
      "text": "……切。从刚才起就一口一个猫亲的吵死了。\n这家伙叫霸王。你小子别随便给它起名字。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_g:cmd-000125:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4d1fc02f6dd5db19d13ea5844ae5b94f8cfab7d4291e1e9cc357e448cdb20ec2",
      "text": "原来是霸王亲啊！听起来好强力的名字啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_g:cmd-000131:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ca31576d61c0603dc288ad5112ace0c2309fa8feb00c35403f6b51c6a9399b1e",
      "text": "那是当然。\n这可是本大爷亲自给它起的名字。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_g:cmd-000134:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9bc4c68c964cfd4ddcfe7b054a864061ecd197bd1609e19848f7b3cfd7f0c87e",
      "text": "这么说来，是涟亲在照顾的猫亲啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_g:cmd-000141:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c6ab7ad91a3d8cdfb86fd3e3c8ddd7804b80ee7cbe96ac38dfb8ce7b561a3b8",
      "text": "唔……偶尔喂喂它罢了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_g:cmd-000148:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1edbca6077450336a48c47fa71de2476b16e44aafe3dda7fad96ac75fccf6cac",
      "text": "也就是说！涟亲也是Respect猫亲的同伴了呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_g:cmd-000152:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:66856d88f0c55b709f830b4990b697c026645b609bcc90bdd9e3168df6147977",
      "text": "哈啊？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_g:cmd-000162:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6798905d7ab1ef836e16a16fab07f5244974c8be51b38576dd9880e465081871",
      "text": "（嘿嘿，感觉能和涟亲成为好朋友了！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_h:cmd-000022:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_h:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:292dc9f92c7443ea14ee798a11be17d26704be62fb0bad3ffde2b53004a69fd2",
      "text": "涟亲，这边这边！制作人酱\n交代的问卷，大家一起来写吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_h:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:840ea6763c2e5219b86da7d4054ee8c8875ad1b734e690e4e99034429b04e782",
      "text": "吵死人了，四眼仔！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_h:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5081620c413dc3af84c930f4445aa211606397e4c6c19ab167fbb3179652697e",
      "text": "啊——！涟亲，既然要去练习室的话，\n要不要一起过去？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_h:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:28d3ef1af0385eed63729f8e1d0abc923e5289ce53a5a8f046c40247f0e6efaa",
      "text": "烦人……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_h:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9c9c7bfd1dc61ac55561a95dad5f1276be8041f078bb0e169b0e5e9c62b01a3e",
      "text": "啊，涟亲，等等我啊！\n我也一起去！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_h:cmd-000116:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9bd4c56d6b0446b247a8afa9d7ed182197ed5c8c919464359d31cf0a3c442b41",
      "text": "呜～涟亲的舞跳得简直太Mega最棒了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_h:cmd-000123:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8c3966ceb9d82c598da6539df77dd2fd540d88a42f9a085cbaad96578cd7e66f",
      "text": "哼，能做到这种程度是理所当然的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_h:cmd-000141:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5bebb356de5f44d33c8f62b2fd461ca0f3be2ce82215d48b602eadbc363b58eb",
      "text": "是啊，真是精彩的步伐！\n比以前还要更加熟练了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_h:cmd-000151:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d3f7aba8a17cd882c85e95c023aff1adcdb0e2f89dbb91bd9b0a36ce4ae52df3",
      "text": "那、那个，涟君！\n可以教我跳舞吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_h:cmd-000158:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:98158ee28ff03db3b001abc10797203ff3d2a60d6af5d3a40b4ede5936708087",
      "text": "哈啊？本大爷凭什么\n要做那种事啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_h:cmd-000169:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:225693c01be2ba438a02876be5e87003d1fb300c1dc0cbc14a433b118b0f4097",
      "text": "我、我想让舞跳得那么好的涟君帮我看看。\n拜托了……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_i:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4456c27fa0eda830264bbdb110f0d884a7edb916a57898935cec491136eb9388",
      "text": "好——！我也要！\n我也想要涟亲的指导！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_i:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ddc060441d9dc4122dfbc12d2b98f639091e794756cdd51e0841784b2dc8bbb5",
      "text": "我也拜托您了。牙崎先生的舞蹈，\n确实令人叹为观止。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_i:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:869e358454b0c210d3f2e06cdd656fe6c95637fa9fced42b3eb283d215acf602",
      "text": "不行吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_i:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:09e7c582f24f533b188a429398c5c09efc37a1544ccd13c7286bdd715f094740",
      "text": "就是这样啊，涟亲！\n就像直央亲说的那样，你的舞技是断层第一啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_i:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ec15ca3865fff958c0b3aca7fb41acc3715ac69ebbee456cbbe7a76b7b685c4b",
      "text": "我、我想向涟君请教。\n因为我无论如何都想让这次的工作成功！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_i:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c8c738e550197330acc50618839ffdeec852fcdad08fe64b1697661c970e9bf2",
      "text": "（莫非……牙崎先生也觉得\n教导别人是一件很困难的事吗？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_i:cmd-000111:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8a96ec8189eddb5d60129eecdc7088f86811ab517db4088d00238a9e88743d0a",
      "text": "喂，你那是什么眼神……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_i:cmd-000122:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f67aa89a65974aab41c66a80c6ca5464fb3ebf818dba78ec6f3d4fabcf8150d7",
      "text": "啊，失礼了。我刚才在想，或许牙崎先生也有\n不擅长的事情呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_i:cmd-000129:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:156fa7d02e3d552d4ccd39126a212b15e6203849f9778cdfdf337a62edc2f096",
      "text": "向别人传达事情的困难之处，我也十分能体会。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_i:cmd-000141:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4ed46334c5b218b0da05c67df677c54eda910a54ccbc9fc9ecc903ed075622dc",
      "text": "哈啊？本大爷怎么可能会有那种玩意。\n最强超级大天才的本大爷可是无所不能的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_i:cmd-000145:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:046e20319027be7c87c5604b19b69afcfc1d24f419e2fe76d8a033cdc08225e6",
      "text": "别把我和你们这群杂鱼混为一谈。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_i:cmd-000167:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:082f3771505f4a45171d94bfd4022ece994147f59512effb69d6ff21192d12ef",
      "text": "这么说，你愿意教我们跳舞了吗！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_i:cmd-000176:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:698ecb7b6850af86658dab828a69bfda903bb30209ebadb4644f95271e4cd7d3",
      "text": "真的吗！谢谢你，涟君。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_i:cmd-000203:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:55bad19e30686a6e48ebecbd9cebe6c7b67c9d2b526269c3ed566352149bd636",
      "text": "啊啊！？怎么就变成这样了！\n我可一个字都没答应过！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_i:cmd-000206:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:39068ef7d785b0751cf6e9cd92f7e113eec9a236c3b7bcb4555988bff9a57731",
      "text": "涟先生，我也拜托你了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_i:cmd-000222:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b0afc6ca286f7964bf5b31462e518447e270b0e1ab603632bd8093c9b7b8cee6",
      "text": "你这家伙什么时候冒出来的。\n……切。就稍微教一下啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_i:cmd-000234:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e9b60d61bb9d6e17ee287c1b81f1a79a9c990459f4c47d7f103c7ffb54eab8dc",
      "text": "好、好的！非常感谢。\n我会努力的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_i:cmd-000244:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8167ac4c609b263b2b7871608e76ed3c190710897ba682fc9b7f599682c97b4e",
      "text": "哼。听好了，敢在本大爷面前\n露出丢人现眼的窝囊样试试看！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_j:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:822a12c9ecba048b0169b70140362863bbc53224a39827c049130d176b1a4065",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー酱，\n我们现在正在集思广益，方便听听吗！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_j:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ad469e298f39bd28fd3610ed3d6d045fa313968b90ae9067e38cbb4bdf6d6283",
      "text": "怎么了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_j:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:82c7c64b435910a2c88fa5405e55a8bba10eae386a67e5f3071d0ed5e5ee7e17",
      "text": "我们刚才在聊，想准备一份谢礼\n送给帮我们指导舞蹈的涟君。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_j:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d8542ac5166cc917d743bde2c48e8f47091e4efb60180be39a94677fc4903fa5",
      "text": "多亏了牙崎先生的建议，\n我跳得比以前更加流畅了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_j:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f11ae2eabab48a1b2c0fd6067b328f662feec49fd20d4c8e3fe7f22d5530951e",
      "text": "原来是……啊，涟先生好像过来了。\n直接问本人是最妥当的哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_j:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e98c04ae2efef3e5ff2be1efe8ce999cba5c6d41eaefa226ac130771e004502e",
      "text": "啊？……干嘛啊。\n敢瞪我，胆子挺肥的嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_j:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0d74bcf2f2370f7f79afbee53d012696d3ed29619c628148f3b9fad493712e2e",
      "text": "大家好像有事情想问涟先生哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_j:cmd-000086:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_j:cmd-000124:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:15bb032602ae539d14450f484a9f76de677d245e3eca51f3c0dfa37f3a010875",
      "text": "各位，练习辛苦了！\n差不多该休息一下了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_j:cmd-000138:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ffd89af4fe27e65e5c18fe2cc393cf8c0c5ce69ae38ed22030890f4629e913ee",
      "text": "哎呀，今天的点心也很丰盛呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_j:cmd-000143:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9db8d80cfa76aae7acd6933a1e8b98863e69d9ba2e381fa2d47266d991dac09b",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，\n非常感谢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_j:cmd-000161:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1e8d1db33a3e3a30b9ab907a6bb22fc9db107b32095b89c4e42518b90b4b0bd8",
      "text": "我开动啦——！\n……嗯～这个团子超级好吃！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_j:cmd-000166:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:36537e53989fa10363981dc9ec37c5331a5262f33cd34387679cb1ee7b93cd64",
      "text": "来，直央亲也请慢用☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_j:cmd-000175:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0dfe4a69244da0be2b25bf23ada1afd27588b13f68b68eb8e7e4ccbea90489ca",
      "text": "啊，谢谢……\n嚼嚼……呵呵，真好吃。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_j:cmd-000188:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c940336b53a23448198bb9dab75a6e63a9cf4764b9815f233456f985cae97fbd",
      "text": "喂，下仆！\n团子不够吃了。再去给我多买点来！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_j:cmd-000209:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0b2cc0ea4bbf6b4d2004522d4464e19c7c8821b9ba4fa064110c0030f2dd89cd",
      "text": "明天终于要\n录制音乐节目了<emoji>image_talk_emoji_19</emoji>",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_j:cmd-000211:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:98353c36c3f74ba1a4790d3e7ea557e5191995649bb4f145b26e57c64f1d39f4",
      "text": "问卷也顺利\n填写完毕了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_j:cmd-000213:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:06d0d062ce29bdd749d1e457f11dd267d33bdcf934924600b829a565545cf4fd",
      "text": "接下来就只剩\n迎接正式演出了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_j:cmd-000215:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d5c6be50af0c5a5f07c89ac2860074f7b4539b1fb19154d44c58e53669e2f86b",
      "text": "嗯。在MC环节想聊的事情\n已经准备了好多好多。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_j:cmd-000217:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:54a43f1d107845d6e75de2ee24a3502980f93f5d8897498e402b4f8dc0cfe766",
      "text": "大家，\n都打算聊些什么呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_j:cmd-000219:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1e5ecf493b4050a6497151d6448c58fcf96cd21ab65893f83e4bc8fddf9fbcb0",
      "text": "太多了都不知道选哪个好<emoji>image_talk_emoji_28</emoji>\n涟亲打算聊什么啊？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_j:cmd-000221:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1f0306d1d89920f5228667ba911fb7b7393361fd74ec2d9611ad1e2f58100574",
      "text": "喂——，涟亲？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_j:cmd-000223:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b959a2550d1e9219014d90eb6cf10a50788f80f7550fb1582b4055f0cece59e9",
      "text": "说不定没在\n看手机呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_j:cmd-000223:choice_detail:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:da7639aa1ea214a2e40541b9fd8bf0013bd3351dd7e94e69a3a0ab005b681fd0",
      "text": "因为他对机械不太习惯。\n说不定并没有在看手机\n呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_j:cmd-000224:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:97e2f0c08b7197cb9921ba829076b0c81020247ccf32fbeebddc4316717b2257",
      "text": "说不定已经休息了",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_j:cmd-000224:choice_detail:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9cea1166cdf4ad4e02f894631f8221a37efc2d9c3ccf7e78aaa6b882132b26ac",
      "text": "今天也很忙碌，\n说不定他已经休息了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_j:cmd-000228:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0c8a4c5f2c92f08c67852072ef9bb153aa531128c142727aa22472ab70294986",
      "text": "确实呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_j:cmd-000230:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:506189d70074c31060b5f51a004cec94aef104232405daf68612a93eda2e94c0",
      "text": "我们也为了明天做好准备，\n早点休息吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_j:cmd-000232:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d5a70a860d1579f587c812a8231d1309715c80c0c081de3fd31acc0f2e7359c4",
      "text": "明天就拜托\n大家了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_j:cmd-000232:choice_detail:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:286b4d47fe726a31a34be14ea9aaeb6641e949d4ab2c169cbbc55f0ff535c38c",
      "text": "各位，明天\n请多关照了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_j:cmd-000235:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:042e5788c34783ee5184ffb7c0b1fe511fc5c87c0f7f133ff663d99b6d8033e4",
      "text": "管他呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_k:cmd-000023:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:150cf7004730a0d0640fb5937c5f5182649bcb49fdaa853651bbdca5af477d08",
      "text": "录制当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_k:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:391bfac4f6b4298546cfa72536704deab6302e2a5b950c070ecc31b815046a44",
      "text": "接下来要介绍的是，来自315 Production的\n白色情人节限定特别组合！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_k:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:838b89dc6a58aef136d06b036c189e4ea6b422a9ac67dd841952edda8614e30a",
      "text": "那么，让我们来听听各位的想法吧。\n组成组合之后，有什么变化吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_k:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:19538b9c00e41c9fbc780b7c5ac8a46b9ca51f0554e1903c306ff7bfc295848d",
      "text": "那个，在练习过程中，\n有了大家一起吃点心的时间。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_k:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2fdf0f730c84ff8d271db7c5a55f29905a1f82f6fc96ea2b3799b3628262955e",
      "text": "好——！托组成组合的福，\n我和涟亲成了猫亲朋友☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_k:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:97009aa9b3bc4d6b8eb908da031977e17684630c19992c69ed12f73bd3a3e4c5",
      "text": "我可不记得跟你是那种关系。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_k:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:203c720a2c8621f42407ba8f94f4d173db1b0348893430668a7a3b29da1fede2",
      "text": "那就从现在开始！\n我们是猫亲朋友啦♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_k:cmd-000109:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e2792957c05f26f64fdda82a819d99142010a5974c92c0d3755a8de8fa0ecf02",
      "text": "啊哈哈，真是很棒的关系呢！\n古论先生，请向大家介绍一下新歌吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_k:cmd-000121:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9c0ce7991abdc54fe25fad693d6a0f0ccda431b67e2f5bbec11d77df7ed2e101",
      "text": "我们有幸演唱的这首歌，是情人节时\n与CM联动的歌曲的后续。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_k:cmd-000128:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:66bae1d6b99c1695c6e89ef12ea291f0caba8f08b95ba850aad9b7b87d815341",
      "text": "视角不同的歌词，\n也请大家务必多多关注。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_k:cmd-000133:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d2faab4fe0dfdede03bb7e2407fc9024e16ef3e5dd9d33ee91c493d1e9e217eb",
      "text": "非常感谢。\n那么牙崎先生，最后请谈谈看点吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_k:cmd-000149:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a955ac52a9d9ea92f32b9c57ff823f84681545617353fb1710f104b287c4851c",
      "text": "那还用问吗。\n当然是本大爷了！库哈哈！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
